o/storage/disk59/seasons/ea20cc0d-855d-4d36-8c62-9a3c058996f6.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk59/seasons/9a5889ee-10b8-481d-aeab-972e7192dd2c.jpg","likes":10,"dislikes":1,"views":2009,"release_date":"1367971200000","season_number":1,"description":"To escape her cruel stepmother, Lu Zhen enters the palace as an attendant. She was quickly promoted through the ranks for her pottery-making skill. During this time, she captures the heart of crown prince Gao Zhan. However, she can never be with him as social status and jealous enemies work against her at every turn. She devotes herself to politics and helps Gao Zhan defeat a coup d'etat. Though Gao Zhan can not make her his empress, he bestows her with the highest position in the land, the female prime minister.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.3}],"value":8.3,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":5714,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}